<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Ultrainfo (converted from the organizer's official GPX download)" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>The Pistol Ultra Imperial course loop</name>
    <desc>One 10-mile Imperial loop at Springbrook Pool in Alcoa, TN; the 100-mile race runs it ten times. Track points and elevations copy the organizer's official Imperial GPX download ("The Pistol - Imperial 100 M 50M 20M 10M", linked from the Course Route page; retrieved 2026-08-13); its single FINISH waypoint is omitted as redundant with the start/finish station waypoint. The loop GPS-measures 10.17 miles with a 3-foot closure against the billed 10-mile frame, which governs pass miles. Station waypoints are placed on the track at each station's first published loop mile: Woody's at 1.9 (the 8.1 pass runs 317 feet away across the greenway) and Lucky's at 4.0 (the 6.1 pass runs 525 feet away), with the Long Run Store station at the loop start/finish.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.pistolultra.com/Race/ThePistolCreekRun/Page/Course-Route"><text>The Pistol course route page</text></link>
  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="35.793574" lon="-83.977175">
